# render-card demo — a heavier frame for a how-to card.
name: render-subsection
title: One section at a time
theme: double
description: |
  A SemText document renders whole, or one section at a time:

    semtext render demo/auth-notes.sem.html --section fetch-queue

  `semtext toc demo/auth-notes.sem.html` lists the sections and
  subsections first — with the ids and numbers that --section takes.
